ugger attached to production","Restarting Studio","Editing XML on the worker"],"explanation":"Logs and monitoring."}}},{"domain":"D11","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué conviene evitar en los logs de producción?","options":["Mensajes de nivel INFO con el identificador de correlación de cada petición","Datos sensibles","El nombre del flujo que procesa la petición","Marcas de tiempo"],"correct":[1],"explanation":"No registrar PII ni secretos.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What should be avoided in production logs?","options":["INFO messages with each request's correlation ID","Sensitive data","The name of the flow processing the request","Timestamps"],"explanation":"Don't log PII or secrets."}}},{"domain":"D11","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué permite la herramienta Spy de MUnit?","options":["Inspeccionar el evento antes y después de un procesador","Simular la respuesta de un sistema externo con datos de ejemplo","Cambiar la configuración","Desplegar la aplicación en un entorno de pruebas aislado"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Spy añade verificaciones alrededor de un procesador.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does MUnit Spy allow?","options":["Inspecting the event before and after a processor","Simulating an external system response with sample data","Changing config","Deploying the app to an isolated test environment"],"explanation":"Spy adds checks around a processor."}}},{"domain":"D11","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué indica Verify Call en MUnit?","options":["Cuántas veces se llamó a un procesador","La cobertura","El valor exacto del payload al final de la prueba ejecutada","El tiempo de respuesta máximo permitido para el flujo"],"correct":[0],"explanation":"Verifica invocaciones.","i18n":{"en":{"stem":"What does MUnit Verify Call check?","options":["How many times a processor was called","Coverage","The exact payload value at the end of the test","The flow's max allowed response time"],"explanation":"It verifies invocations."}}},{"domain":"D11","source":"bank","stem":"¿Qué conviene si 